@@ -41,0 +43,2 @@ The profile composition owns each root agent's tools. `input`, `output`, and `ex
+With `resumePersistedSessions` enabled, a durable-id collision restores that session through the agent factory using the initialized model options. The stored working directory must equal the initialized directory before restoration. Corrupt data, active ownership, missing persistence, and directory mismatches remain errors; disabling the option preserves fresh-only first use. Restored history stays in that session, and protocol clients receive only the new prompt's activity interval. The [Studio decision](../../../.agents/notes/implemented/feature/2026-10-05-local-studio-employees.md) owns this opt-in use.
